* -dialect=ucc95: Ultra C's r68 of 1994-95 pads the code to 4 with zeros, where the later one
* (ucc) pads with nop (measured 2026-10-15 on objects of an OS-9 V3.0 port); otherwise as ucc.
* fixed: FIXME
* options: -dialect=ucc95
* not r68: the r68 at hand is the later one, which pads with nop
* expect text: 4e714e714e710000
 psect ucc95_pad,0,0,0,0,0
 nop
 nop
 nop
 ends
